Error [E1105]: `#layout(packed)` is reserved and not yet supported
  --> tests/ui/layout_unsupported_variant.jet:1:9
    |
  1 | #layout(packed)
    |         ^^^^^^
 Why: the supported variants are `c` (C-compatible) and `columnar` (struct-of-arrays)
 Fix: use `#layout(c)` or `#layout(columnar)`, or omit `#layout` for the default
